1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.698
Store food safely

2
00:00:01.698 --> 00:00:31.132
Namaste! Aaj ka lesson hai Store food safely. Food ko dhak kar aur sahi jagah rakhna use dust aur insects se bachane mein madad karta hai. Is baat ko dheere-dheere samjhenge, phir ek aasaan example dekhenge. Learning mein galti hona bilkul normal hai; hum har step ko dobara check kar sakte hain.

3
00:00:31.132 --> 00:01:01.132
Bacha hua cooked food adult ki madad se thanda karke fridge mein rakha ja sakta hai. Dhyaan do ki example mein kaunsi cheez badal rahi hai aur kaunsi same rehti hai. Pehle apna andaaza bolo, phir reason dhoondo. Agar tum kisi dost ko samjha sakte ho, to concept aur mazboot ho jaata hai.

4
00:01:01.132 --> 00:01:33.962
Kitchen mein dry grains ka sealed container dekho aur discuss karo ki lid kyun useful hai. Apne observation ko ek sentence mein likho. Har number ya label ke saath sahi unit ya naam lagao. Sawaal solve karte waqt jaldi mat karo; clue ko underline karo, apna tareeka chuno, aur aakhir mein jawab ko example ke saath compare karo.

5
